OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after body
OL,4,Afound in van on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a body was found in a
OL,8,Fvan that was on fire.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to Gas
OL,11,FWorks Lane in Prestatyn, Denbighshire,
OL,12,Fat about 23:30 BST on Sunday after
OL,13,Freports of a van ablaze.
OL,15,FThe identity of the person remains
OL,16,Funknown with the investigation "still
OL,17,Fin the early stages", Det Ch Insp Zoie
OL,18,FDunkerley said.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
