OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after body
OL,4,Afound in van on fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Wales Police have arrested a
OL,7,F38-year-old man on suspicion of murder,
OL,8,Fand an increased police presence will
OL,9,Fbe visible in the area as inquiries
OL,10,Fcontinue.
